      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Tashmin Khamis, Director of AKU's Network of Quality Assurance and Improvement, has been appointed to serve on the board of directors of the International Network for Quality Assurance Agencies in Higher Education (INQAAHE) for a term ending in 2018.  INQAAHE benchmarks quality assurance globally in higher education.  All the commissions that regulate AKU belong to INQAAHE - Higher Education Commission in Pakistan, Commission for University Education in Kenya, Tanzania Commission for Universities, Uganda National Commission for Higher Education and Quality Assurance Agency for Higher Education in the UK."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is a recognition of AKU's quality and leadership in the regions we serve. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
